# **Build-side rules only.** This repository is handler/ and the workflow that builds it;
# nothing here generates a tree, so this file is short and that is the correct length rather
# than a sign something was dropped in the seed.

.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# **Credentials, and this repository is public.** Neither is read at build time — the workflow
# takes its secrets from Actions and the worker takes its own from the job envelope — so a file
# by either name here is a local convenience that must never become a commit. Ignored by name
# so that `git add -A` cannot publish one irreversibly.
.env
.venv/

# **The RIFE weights and the model package, when a local run points at a checkout.**
# handler/rife.py reads RIFE_MODEL_DIR and needs a directory holding train_log/ and model/;
# the image gets them from the bake, and a developer gets them by unpacking the archive —
# often into this tree. flownet.pkl is a PICKLE, so committing one publishes executable code
# under the name of a weights file, and the build's own sha256 assertion is the only thing
# that ever checks it.
train_log/
model/
*.pkl

# **Serena's project state and symbol cache.** Written into the repository root by a tool run
# against this checkout rather than by anything that builds the image. Ignored because a clean
# tree is asserted when certifying a pinned image, and an untracked directory turns that check
# red for a reason unrelated to the image.
.serena/
